            "value" : "编辑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every item goes back to Shown and every other Rolltop setting to its default. Open at login and permissions stay as they are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有项都会回到“显示”分区，Rolltop 的其他设置也会恢复默认。“登录时打开”和权限保持不变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Eye" : {
      "comment" : "Menu bar icon choice",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "眼睛"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Features that need your permission" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要你许可的功能"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "General" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hiding menu bar items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏菜单栏项"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Rolltop’s icon looks in the menu bar. It changes while hidden items are shown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 图标在菜单栏中的样子。显示隐藏项时它会改变。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you hide it, open Rolltop again from Finder or Spotlight to get back here. A shortcut you set in Shortcuts or the link rolltop://settings also works." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "隐藏后，从访达或聚焦再次打开 Rolltop 即可回到这里。也可以使用在“快捷键”中设置的快捷键或链接 rolltop://settings。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep visible when hiding everything" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部隐藏时保持可见"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keeps your menu bar tidy: hide the items you don’t need all the time and bring them back with a click." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让菜单栏保持整洁：隐藏不常用的项，点按一下即可让它们重新出现。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Last problem" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "最近的问题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets Rolltop read the name of the current Wi-Fi network, check place conditions in automations and show the weather where you are." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 Rolltop 读取当前 Wi-Fi 网络的名称、在自动化中检查地点条件，并显示你所在地的天气。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Lets Rolltop see which items are in the menu bar, and open hidden ones." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "让 Rolltop 看到菜单栏中有哪些项，并打开隐藏的项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Location Services" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "定位服务"
