    "Reset…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "重置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop" : {
      "comment" : "Menu bar icon choice: Rolltop's own glyph, drawn like its app icon (not the Shelf feature)",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop can’t hide or list menu bar items until you allow Device Control and Data Access." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你允许“设备控制和数据访问”之前，Rolltop 无法隐藏或列出菜单栏项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop is an independent app. It is not made, endorsed or supported by Apple or by the makers of any other menu bar app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 是一款独立 App，并非由 Apple 或任何其他菜单栏 App 的开发者制作、认可或支持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop is running from %@. macOS hides the menu bar items of apps outside the Applications folder, Rolltop’s own included. Move Rolltop to Applications and open it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 正在从 %@ 运行。macOS 会隐藏“应用程序”文件夹之外的 App 的菜单栏项，Rolltop 自己的也不例外。请将 Rolltop 移到“应用程序”文件夹并重新打开。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Rolltop starts when you log in, so hidden items stay hidden." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 会在你登录时启动，因此隐藏项会保持隐藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Search" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "搜索"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Section for new items" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "新项所在分区"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select All" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全选"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Select a category" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择一个类别"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show License" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示许可证"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show Rolltop in the menu bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在菜单栏中显示 Rolltop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows the real icons of hidden items. Without it, Rolltop shows app icons instead." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示隐藏项的真实图标。没有此权限时，Rolltop 会改为显示 App 图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stack" : {
      "comment" : "Menu bar icon choice",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "堆叠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Rolltop was started from a terminal. macOS would record what you allow now for the terminal instead of Rolltop, so these buttons are off. Quit Rolltop and open it from Applications." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个 Rolltop 是从终端启动的。现在允许的权限会被 macOS 记录给终端而不是 Rolltop，因此这些按钮已停用。请退出 Rolltop，再从“应用程序”文件夹打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This can’t be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This version of macOS doesn’t offer what Rolltop uses to hide items, so every item stays visible." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此版本的 macOS 不提供 Rolltop 隐藏项所需的功能，因此所有项都会保持可见。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turn on Location Services in System Settings › Privacy & Security." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在“系统设置 › 隐私与安全”中打开定位服务。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unavailable" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "不可用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "撤销"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@ (%@)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Version %1$@ (%2$@)"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本 %1$@（%2$@）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Versions, permissions, where Rolltop runs from and whether it is hiding anything. No item names or settings." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本、权限、Rolltop 的运行位置以及是否正在隐藏项。不含项名称或设置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for your approval in System Settings › General › Login Items & Extensions." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在等待你在“系统设置 › 通用 › 登录项与扩展”中批准。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When Rolltop also hides the items you normally see, these stay in the menu bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当 Rolltop 连你平时看到的项也一并隐藏时，这些项仍会留在菜单栏中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where apps go the first time they show up in the menu bar. Items already there keep their section." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "App 第一次出现在菜单栏时所放入的分区。已在菜单栏中的项保持原有分区。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Window" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "窗口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Rolltop’s icon hidden, nothing shows hidden items: clicking the empty menu bar, hovering, scrolling and shortcuts are all off. Turn one on in Reveal or Shortcuts." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Rolltop 图标隐藏后，没有任何方式能显示隐藏项：点按菜单栏空白处、悬停、滚动和快捷键都已关闭。请在“显示与收起”或“快捷键”中打开其中一种。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "device control, data access, accessibility, screen recording, system audio, privacy, access, allow" : {
      "comment" : "Settings search keywords, comma separated",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "权限, 设备控制, 数据访问, 无障碍, 辅助功能, 录屏, 屏幕录制, 系统录音, 隐私, 访问, 允许"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "diagnostics, reset, troubleshoot, debug" : {
      "comment" : "Settings search keywords, comma separated",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "高级, 诊断, 重置, 故障排除, 调试"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "login, startup, launch, new items, default section, menu bar icon, status item, symbol, pinned, keep visible, hide everything" : {
      "comment" : "Settings search keywords, comma separated",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
